{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23458","headline":"得湖州崔十八使君书喜与杭越邻郡因成长句代贺兼寄微之 · 白居易","name":"得湖州崔十八使君书喜与杭越邻郡因成长句代贺兼寄微之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三郡何因此结缘，贞元科第忝同年。\n故情欢喜开书後，旧事思量在眼前。\n越国封疆吞碧海，杭城楼合入青烟。\n吴兴卑小君应屈，爲是蓬莱最後仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23458.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23458","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}